    {
      "name": "08 Channel Config — SMTP / WhatsApp / Escalation (read-only)",
      "description": "PUT endpoints for these three are intentionally left out of this validation collection. The platform sends real mail through the live Subex SMTP relay (see CLAUDE.md — no local mail catcher), so mutating SmtpConfig/WhatsAppConfig/EscalationConfig here risks changing live send behavior rather than just validating a code path. Exercise those PUTs manually and deliberately from the dashboard, not as part of an automated collection run.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get SMTP Config",
